{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"enrollUserPresence"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"savePrivateKey"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"SecKeyAddType","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.ibm.verify.ios.sdk\/documentation\/Core\/SecKeyAddType","preciseIdentifier":"s:4Core13SecKeyAddTypeO"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"parameters":[{"name":"savePrivateKey","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A closure that receives the generated private key wrapped in a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SecKeyAddType"},{"type":"text","text":" and returns the label under which the key was stored. The closure may throw if storage fails."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The function generates a new private\/public key pair, stores the private key using the provided storage function, and then performs the enrollment using the resulting key name and public key.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The caller supplies a "},{"code":"savePrivateKey","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" closure, which receives a "},{"code":"SecKeyAddType","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" describing the private key that should be persisted. In this enrollment flow, the closure will always be invoked with "},{"code":"SecKeyAddType.key","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", containing:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"the raw private key data (","type":"text"},{"code":"Data","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":")","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"the key size in bits"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"the algorithm used to generate the key"}]}]}]},{"code":["import Core","","try await enrollUserPresence(","    savePrivateKey: { key in","        \/\/ We know only `.key` will be passed","        guard case let .key(value, size, algorithm) = key else {","            throw MFARegistrationError.invalidRegistrationData(reason: \"Expected SecKeyAddType.key but received a different case.\")","        }","","        \/\/ Generate a unique label for the key","        let keyLabel = \"\\(UUID().uuidString).userPresence\"","","        try KeychainService.default.addItem(keyLabel, value: .key(value: value, size: size, algorithm: algorithm))","        return keyLabel","    }",")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When storing the key, use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SecAccessControlCreateFlags.userPresence"},{"type":"text","text":" in your "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SecAccessControl"},{"type":"text","text":" configuration. This ensures the key is protected by biometrics with automatic fallback to the device passcode, providing a smooth and secure user experience across Face ID, Touch ID, and PIN‑based verification.  See "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/developer.apple.com\/documentation\/security\/secaccesscontrolcreateflags","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"note","name":"Throws","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Errors related to biometric evaluation, key generation, or enrollment.","type":"text"}]}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/mfa\/onpremiseregistrationprovider\/enrolluserpresence(saveprivatekey:)"]}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.ibm.verify.ios.sdk\/documentation\/MFA\/OnPremiseRegistrationProvider\/enrollUserPresence(savePrivateKey:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.ibm.verify.ios.sdk\/documentation\/MFA","doc:\/\/com.ibm.verify.ios.sdk\/documentation\/MFA\/OnPremiseRegistrationProvider"]]},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Enrolls a signature‑based authentication method.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"enrollUserPresence(savePrivateKey:)","externalID":"s:3MFA29OnPremiseRegistrationProviderC18enrollUserPresence14savePrivateKeyySS4Core03SecK7AddTypeOKXE_tYaKF","modules":[{"name":"MFA"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"enrollUserPresence"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"savePrivateKey"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:4Core13SecKeyAddTypeO","text":"SecKeyAddType"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method"},"references":{"doc://com.ibm.verify.ios.sdk/documentation/MFA/OnPremiseRegistrationProvider":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OnPremiseRegistrationProvider"}],"url":"\/documentation\/mfa\/onpremiseregistrationprovider","title":"OnPremiseRegistrationProvider","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.ibm.verify.ios.sdk\/documentation\/M